{"w":2400,"lines":[{"c":1,"t":"Test 1","x":0.12757201604786825,"y":0.10453474698483933,"w":0.057613169352213528,"h":0.013250883392226132},{"y":0.14811542992538318,"t":"READING PASSAGE 2","x":0.12962962795765481,"h":0.014723203769140158,"c":1,"w":0.28806584676106772},{"w":0.77572016398111976,"x":0.12962962999068983,"h":0.017462404653236896,"t":"You should spend about 20 minutes on Questions 14-26, which are based on Reading","y":0.18021201410201104,"c":1},{"y":0.19905771515238602,"h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1,"x":0.1275720172563988,"w":0.16049382527669273,"t":"Passage 2 below."},{"w":0.016460905075073251,"c":1,"t":"D","h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.13168724285340988,"y":0.83866279044930658},{"x":0.41563785961235716,"w":0.20987654368082681,"h":0.016007204359074878,"c":1,"t":"Driverless cars","y":0.23546511611680176},{"h":0.019280187653989644,"x":0.15012900380021629,"y":0.26858303778996451,"w":0.72236373901367179,"c":1,"t":"The automotive sector is well used to adapting to automation in manufacturing."},{"t":"The implementation of robotic car manufacture from the 1970s onwards led to","y":0.28496913553164382,"w":0.68956100463867198,"x":0.17269651633395161,"h":0.019182526461508087,"c":1},{"t":"significant cost savings and improvements in the reliability and flexibility of vehicle","h":0.018344731999229813,"c":1,"y":0.30296270899211164,"x":0.17071128949553108,"w":0.72648300170898428},{"h":0.018814787847835746,"t":"mass production. A new challenge to vehicle production is now on the horizon","y":0.31962526681364278,"x":0.17070601620827119,"w":0.69150761922200521,"c":1},{"x":0.17078189645650355,"t":"and, again, it comes from automation. However, this time it is not to do with the","h":0.017489796673310742,"c":1,"w":0.69958847045898442,"y":0.33716136626883975},{"x":0.17078188287106921,"h":0.017667844522968212,"y":0.35453474696513998,"w":0.51028808593749997,"t":"manufacturing process, but with the vehicles themselves.","c":1},{"h":0.019971293751567143,"t":"Research projects on vehicle automation are not new. Vehicles with limited self-","x":0.17268711454550725,"w":0.70605443318684902,"y":0.38491910608149438,"c":1},{"x":0.17069674749807717,"y":0.40237693937808139,"h":0.019955252028466486,"w":0.745067392985026,"c":1,"t":"driving capabilities have been around for more than 50 years, resulting in significant"},{"x":0.17078189382480238,"h":0.016043156420524562,"c":1,"w":0.71810699462890626,"t":"contributions towards driver assistance systems. But since Google announced in","y":0.42005813938201819},{"w":0.73456792195638032,"h":0.017441860778592999,"c":1,"t":"2010 that it had been trialling self-driving cars on the streets of California, progress","x":0.17078188370630926,"y":0.43604651142964035},{"w":0.34362139383951823,"x":0.17078189557180651,"y":0.45494186031423745,"c":1,"t":"in this field has quickly gathered pace.","h":0.01598837238037687},{"y":0.48691860450304469,"w":0.7345679219563801,"h":0.016026036337772775,"c":1,"t":"There are many reasons why technology is advancing so fast. One frequently cited","x":0.17283949581021868},{"w":0.72442916870117191,"x":0.17276568263097261,"t":"motive is safety; indeed, research at the UK's Transport Research Laboratory has","y":0.50257482891692984,"h":0.019856269845412111,"c":1},{"t":"demonstrated that more than 90 percent of road collisions involve human error as a","y":0.51815148869782768,"w":0.73894561767578126,"h":0.019894821202937507,"x":0.17269728329760484,"c":1},{"t":"contributory factor, and it is the primary cause in the vast majority. Automation may","x":0.17270487975018625,"y":0.53406714892484286,"c":1,"h":0.022024493897059516,"w":0.73276494344075527},{"y":0.55523255800199822,"h":0.014555427856804748,"t":"help to reduce the incidence of this.","c":1,"x":0.17283950343259472,"w":0.32304527282714834},{"x":0.17276917395524397,"c":1,"t":"Another aim is to free the time people spend driving for other purposes. If the","w":0.68327453613281253,"y":0.5856427476579581,"h":0.018810405888461945},{"c":1,"h":0.016195524146054185,"t":"vehicle can do some or all of the driving, it may be possible to be productive, to","x":0.17283951793279745,"y":0.60306242662390874,"w":0.7016460673014322},{"t":"socialise or simply to relax while automation systems have responsibility for safe","h":0.018782572976551615,"y":0.61875362995745642,"x":0.1727386867443112,"c":1,"w":0.71418518066406267},{"c":1,"x":0.17283950779336862,"y":0.63662790681368642,"t":"control of the vehicle. If the vehicle can do the driving, those who are challenged","w":0.71193415323893228,"h":0.017441860778592888},{"x":0.17275436325838334,"w":0.72651967366536452,"h":0.019110000035226449,"c":1,"t":"by existing mobility models - such as older or disabled travellers - may be able to","y":0.6524960277120917},{"x":0.17489711623869103,"w":0.38065844217936201,"h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1,"t":"enjoy significantly greater travel autonomy.","y":0.67137809200899723},{"c":1,"h":0.020398403927069597,"w":0.72449523925781256,"t":"Beyond these direct benefits, we can consider the wider implications for transport","y":0.70182452596243972,"x":0.17070077216934634},{"t":"and society, and how manufacturing processes might need to respond as a","c":1,"x":0.17481055229369788,"y":0.71930694047625865,"w":0.66476537068684893,"h":0.017945115501664333},{"y":0.73538156199457028,"w":0.72242075602213551,"t":"result. At present, the average car spends more than 90 percent of its life parked.","h":0.019696181738755758,"c":1,"x":0.17272333820787697},{"y":0.75146704472713255,"x":0.17484619990320463,"w":0.67707555135091146,"c":1,"t":"Automation means that initiatives for car-sharing become much more viable,","h":0.018904278219378012},{"h":0.019439657950429456,"c":1,"t":"particularly in urban areas with significant travel demand. If a significant proportion","x":0.17476779460475333,"w":0.72863698323567705,"y":0.7683959820466767},{"x":0.1748971282556683,"t":"of the population choose to use shared automated vehicles, mobility demand can","w":0.72016459147135425,"h":0.017667844522968212,"c":1,"y":0.78621908101492499},{"x":0.17489711786373571,"y":0.80523255799616977,"w":0.25925926208496097,"h":0.014555427856804859,"c":1,"t":"be met by far fewer vehicles."},{"t":"The Massachusetts Institute of Technology investigated automated mobility in","c":1,"x":0.17078189032071681,"w":0.69135803222656267,"y":0.83568904590564885,"h":0.016195524146054185},{"h":0.020427005170231327,"x":0.17479057947215626,"y":0.85168539516030572,"c":1,"w":0.7245204162597656,"t":"Singapore, finding that fewer than 30 percent of the vehicles currently used would"},{"x":0.17489714035333065,"t":"be required if fully automated car sharing could be implemented. If this is the case,","c":1,"y":0.8677325582951888,"w":0.73456787109374999,"h":0.018898772968701127},{"y":0.88532681760523912,"t":"it might mean that we need to manufacture far fewer vehicles to meet demand.","w":0.70181432088216145,"x":0.17479051283072675,"c":1,"h":0.018945655777822257},{"x":0.13168724279863336,"y":0.92151162763101269,"w":0.024691357612609849,"c":1,"h":0.014534883982160851,"t":"20"}],"h":3395}